      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It sounds a little better than current way to me. But it's also very concerning since it has to collect or read more behavioral data, which is not great for privacy. VRChat is more private space than Discord is for many people. Hard to say it's better by a lot. \n\nI upvote this since I think it will prevent easy identity theft and you can get a little more control of what information you pass to the companies.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
