  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-10-17T16:13:59.932Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd like to suggest letting users verify their age through their existing Discord age verification status, as an alternative to submitting a government ID to a third-party provider\n\nI'm not comfortable handing my ID to an outside company for privacy reasons. Discord's recent age verification rollout automatically verified me as an adult without having to provide any personally identifying information\n\nI only need age verification to continue accessing rave venues I’ve been attending for years, which I've been increasingly locked out of due to the mass adoption of this system",
